      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We are extremely impressed with the excellent service provided by Green cell Energy and the high quality of the equipment and solar panels, especially designed to guarantee safety and avoiding any problems of over heating or rusting panels.  MANY THANKS TO ALL THE VERY OBLIGING TEAM FOR ALL THEIR HELP.The remarkable savings on our electricity bills are extraordinary and very welcome as our income is limited to the aged pension: the past three energy accounts being only: $55, $51 and an unbelievable $44.00 each month.  We are running our spa every day for 6 hours on the cleaning cycle, the air conditioners, fans, stove, cooking and other cleaning appliances, automatic dish washer, clothes dryer and washer in addition to a double door fridge, netflix TV and occasionally the welder and other tools in the workshop, etc.  Sometimes the fan and air conditioner may also be needed through the night.  We are keeping very cool and comfortable on a very affordable electricity budget thanks to Greencell Energy.We highly recommend Green cell Energy to other discerning users wishing to ensure top quality fittings and service as well as saving themselves an amazing amount of money every month.   Lorraine and John Wiltshire",
