      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My installation was a little different. Primarily I needed a PV system. However as I was building a shed and needing power from the house to be run to it Greencell's team was able to help.They were able to negotiate with Ergon re the single phase to 3 phase upgrade, upgrade the switchboard, dig the trench to the shed for power, install a switchboard to the shed, as well as help place the 13.5 Kw of cells on the house roof in a way so I could get access to clean them.Greencells office team were very helpful in what options were available and were able to tailor a solution that worked perfectly for me. Their installers were likewise very professional  - including allowing me to lay additional data cables and water in the trench (yes 600mm deep.. power.. then backfill to 300mm)I cannot recommend Greencell more for the quality of work that they have done. And this was done in 3 days.I am now happily watching my PV system send 8.8Kwh back in to the grid as well as handling my own needs.Bravo Greencell.. Bravo",
